OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds to sleep on The Kop for
OL,4,Ahomeless charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains references to
OL,7,Fpoor mental health, including suicide.
OL,8,FThe BBC Action Line contains details
OL,9,Fabout a range of support and advice
OL,10,Fservices
OL,12,FHundreds of people will sleep on The
OL,13,FKop at Liverpool's Anfield Stadium
OL,14,Flater to raise awareness of
OL,15,Fhomelessness, addiction and mental
OL,16,Fhealth issues on Merseyside.
OL,18,FNow in its fourth year, Kip on The Kop
OL,19,Fis an annual charity event which also
OL,20,Fraises money for the club's LFC
OL,21,FFoundation.
